---
import Section from '#src/components/section.astro';
export interface Props { class?: string; }
---
<Section id='about' title='About' class={Astro.props.class}>
  <p class="mx-auto w-fit text-justify">
    When I was six years old, I bought my own iPod, I had saved all my money from
    my allowance and my birthday. That is when my love, passion, and interest in
    tech was born. Ever since, it has only grown. Today I'm a student at the TU/e,
    studying Computer Science and Engineering, learning about and handling what I
    love most: technology.
  </p>
</Section>
